---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";

const CONTACT = "contact@peoplesrepublicofbulgaria.com";
---

<Base
  title="Legal notice & privacy | People's Republic of Bulgaria"
  description="Who runs peoplesrepublicofbulgaria.com, what data is collected and how to have it deleted."
  path="/privacy"
>
  <main class="legal">
    <a class="legal__back" href="/">Back to PRB</a>
    <h1>Legal notice &amp; privacy</h1>

    <dl>
      <dt>Who runs this site</dt>
      <dd>Simon Beltran, a private individual, Sofia, Bulgaria. Contact: <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT}`}>{CONTACT}</a></dd>

      <dt>Hosting</dt>
      <dd>Vercel.</dd>

      <dt>What I collect</dt>
      <dd>Your email address, only if you sign up for the newsletter.</dd>

      <dt>Why</dt>
      <dd>To send you the newsletter. Nothing else.</dd>

      <dt>Who handles it</dt>
      <dd>Resend, the service that sends the newsletter emails.</dd>

      <dt>How long</dt>
      <dd>Until you unsubscribe.</dd>

      <dt>Unsubscribe, access or deletion</dt>
      <dd>Just send an email to <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT}`}>{CONTACT}</a>.</dd>

      <dt>Cookies and tracking</dt>
      <dd>No tracking tools on this site. The YouTube video only loads after you click it, and YouTube may then set its own cookies.</dd>
    </dl>
  </main>
</Base>

<style>
  .legal {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 34rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 1rem 1.25rem 1.5rem;
  }
  .legal__back {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    min-height: 44px;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
  }
  h1 {
    margin: 0.5rem 0 1.25rem;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 6.5vw, 2.1rem);
    line-height: 1.15;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--bordeaux);
  }
  dl {
    margin: 0;
  }
  dt {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--gold-text);
  }
  dd {
    margin: 0.125rem 0 0.75rem;
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }
</style>
